# TASK/ACCTITLE zView acceptance: the user's real-Pi sequence (JPEG loaded,
# full screen, Esc) with SYSACC.NAC + SYSACC2.NAC registered. zView is started
# by ZVLAUNCH (#Z) with C:\ZVIEW\SAMPLES\T.JPG. The injector clock arms at the
# first EL0 program, here the first accessory (session start).
# IKBD: F10 44 (zView "Full Screen  F10" -- reached through WinDom's
# menu_exec_cmd, which strstr()s every Desk entry first), Esc 01; break = make|0x80.
# A key follows a MARK by >= 0.6 s (drive-m3 dumps 0.5 s after the MARK).
100 parkbr
4000 mark S00_WINDOW
4300 key 44
4306 key C4
5000 mark S01_FULLSCREEN
5600 key 01
5606 key 81
6400 mark S02_ESC_BACK
6700 key 01
6706 key 81
7300 mark S03_ESC_IN_WINDOW
7700 key 44
7706 key C4
8500 mark S04_FULLSCREEN2
9000 key 01
9006 key 81
9800 mark END
